, the slightest mistake can lead to death. \nThis is a first part of series, which invovles only the section of catacombs.\nTry to find out the mystery in this catacomb and survive.", "short_description": "This is a FPS game which use magic to defeat enemies but not a gun. It is little bit horror but absolutely acceptable for most players. Try it and feel the mysterious of Oriental magic world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.2016vr.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.2016vr.com/", "publisher_name": "Beijing Hulianxingmeng(ISVR)", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.2016vr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "RPG", "SHOOTER", "HORROR", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1082528112317065"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386394_667939700051556_4027902235215134720_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mQneIGrKgnQQ7kNvwE0kurX&_nc_oc=Adqk0laha2b-VdQwKq4gDZe101xeH3iCiPmLJPjvFO2a_Qfy72MRkUXkbUqykbQ0GZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2Jk9QXRXdTp-4NpLTZVY1mT7VWv3svd9QqjILsr5WCeQ&oe=69F367C0"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "The Hunter", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1478729266, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1175424285837667", "release_type": "SCHEDULED",